---
type: digest
status: unread
source: {{ source }}
url: {{ url | yq }}
{% if author %}
author: {{ author | yq }}
{% endif %}
{% if duration %}
duration: "{{ duration }}"
{% endif %}
date_added: {{ date_added.isoformat() }}
read_minutes: {{ d.read_minutes }}
confidence: {{ d.confidence }}
{% if model %}
model: {{ model }}
{% endif %}
{% if via %}
via: {{ via }}
{% endif %}
tags: [{{ d.tags | join(", ") }}]
---
# {{ d.emoji | oneline }} {{ d.title | oneline }}

> [!tldr] Суть за 10 секунд
{% for line in tldr_lines %}
> {{ line }}
{% endfor %}

## 🔑 Главное
{% for point in d.key_points %}
- {{ point | oneline }}
{% endfor %}
{% if d.shortcuts %}

## ⌨️ Горячие клавиши
| Действие | Windows | macOS |
|---|---|---|
{% for s in d.shortcuts %}
| {{ s.action | cell }} | {{ s.windows | keycell }} | {{ s.mac | keycell }} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if d.steps %}

## 🪜 Пошагово
{% for step in d.steps %}
{{ loop.index }}. {{ step | oneline }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if code %}

